      "summary": ": Main Street has come to the party! Now open and beautifully groomed from top to bottom, it's delivering an epic run all the way back to base. Recent snowmaking temperatures have allowed the team to build plenty of snow but do take care on those morning laps. Triple Treat is looking fantastic after an overnight groom, while the Beginner Platter offers a relaxed space for first-timers to build confidence and sharpen skills. Check in at Guest Services to find out about our Group and Private lessons. The Saddle and Summit has plenty of terrain to explore and the Motatapu Chutes open today, There is a NW breeze up top but the good news is there is more snow is in the forecast! Need a tasty lunch between laps? Our fresh Poke Bowls are waiting for you.",
